<h3>privacy policy</h3>
<p>Our mission is to contribute to society through the reservation reception business for condominums, and we strive to improve service quality and customer satisfaction.
In addition, we place importance on compliance and legal compliance, and we believe that protecting personal information is an indispensable social responsibility.
For this reason, we make all employees aware of the importance of protecting personal information and make sure that personal information is always properly handled. Our protection of personal information
We declare our basic stance as follows:</p>

<h4>1. Acquisition, use, and provision of personal information</h4>
<p>
The purpose of use of the personal information we collect is as follows. <br>
・ To provide information on our products and services. <br>
-To send support information about our products. <br>
We collect personal information only to the extent necessary to achieve these purposes. <br>
If we obtain personal information directly from you, we have agreed to the purpose of use and handling in a written or alternative way. (Includes all personal information that we use for our business, including not only customers, but also employees and business partners.) <br>
In addition, except in the following cases, we will not handle the information beyond the scope necessary for achieving the purpose of use (hereinafter referred to as "unintended use") and disclose or provide it to third parties without the consent of the person himself. . Measures to prevent these will be implemented by our personal information protection management system. <br>
(A) When it is based on laws <br>
(B) When it is necessary to protect the life, body or property of a person and it is difficult to obtain the consent of the person <br>
(C) When it is particularly necessary to improve public health or promote the sound development of children and it is difficult to obtain the consent of the individual <br>
(D) When it is necessary for a national organization or local public entity or a person entrusted with it to cooperate in performing the affairs specified by laws and regulations, and with the consent of the person, the performance of such affairs When it may interfere with
</p>

<h4> 2.Compliance with laws, national guidelines and other standards </h4>
<p>
We will comply with laws and regulations regarding personal information, guidelines and other standards set by the government.
</p>
<p>
<h4> 3. Prevention and correction of leakage, loss or damage of personal information </h4>
<p> We will implement necessary and appropriate security measures to prevent and correct leakage, loss or damage of personal information. </p>
<h4> 4. About complaints and consultations regarding personal information </h4>
<p>
We will respond promptly and appropriately to complaints and consultations regarding the handling of personal information. Please contact the following inquiry window for personal information.
In addition, since our company is a target company of the Certified Personal Information Protection Organization "Japan Information Economy and Society Promotion Association", you may also apply to the inquiry window of the following "Japan Information Economy and Society Promotion Association". It is possible.
</p>

<h4> 5. Continuous improvement of personal information protection management system </h4>
<p>
We will establish and operate a personal information protection management system that sets out codes of conduct, internal rules, and rules for the protection and appropriate handling of personal information. In addition, we will continuously improve the personal information protection management system through regular operation inspections, internal audits, and management reviews.

We will make this policy known to all employees and announce it to all concerned.
</p>
